This product uses the NVIDIA NeMo Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 speech-recognition
model, created by NVIDIA and licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), in the int8 export for
sherpa-onnx published by the k2-fsa project
(https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/releases/tag/asr-models, asset
sherpa-onnx-nemo-parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3-int8.tar.bz2). The model weights are
not redistributed in this repository; the installer downloads them from the
k2-fsa release at install time and verifies the checksum.

One small file derived from that model IS redistributed here:
services/stt_providers/sherpa_offline_parakeet_stt_server/model_assets/bpe.vocab,
the model's own sentencepiece sub-word list with its merge scores,
generated from the tokenizer inside NVIDIA's published checkpoint. It is a
derivative of the model above, so it is redistributed under the same
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License and under the
attribution given above. docs/vendoring/SECURITY.md records where it came
from and how it was checked.
